format session-log-v1
stamp 20260815.093042
editor Zed
model Fable 5
voice Kyri
host cloud pier — Eastern (EDT) time convention
title ALES186 — Lotus's reverb: Schroeder's network, parallel combs summed then diffused through series allpasses — the time-based wing's keystone
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the ALES / Lotus edge; approve the design round, make progress, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61; stop at custody gates.
think Read REMEMBER (living edge DREY/HUNK/ALES), the 1,024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat expansion. The living ALES edge is Season C (Lotus). ALES184 seated the mono allpass, ALES185 the stereo allpass; every ALES184/185 doc and the README index name the reverb (parallel combs diffused through series allpasses) as the wing's keystone crux.
think Crux-first: the reverb is the decisive move the whole time-based wing was climbing toward, and it is tractable now precisely because it invents no new arithmetic — every sample is written by a stage already proven byte-for-byte (echo ALES66 as the comb, allpass ALES184 as the diffusion). The reverb's own work is the SHAPE: parallel combs on their own dry copies, summed once through timeline.saturate, then allpasses in series in place.
think Chose the mono reverb (one keystone, the finishing edge) over jumping to the stereo reverb, which becomes a thin twin over this. Kept the network parametrized (bounded slices of CombSpec/AllpassSpec, max_stages 16) so a room preset and Freeverb-sized banks fit without new machinery.
think Atomicity was the design crux beyond the sample laws: a reverb carries many stages, so validate the span and EVERY comb and allpass through the stages' own precheck BEFORE any write — a bad late allpass must leave the clip untouched. Folded EchoError/AllpassError into ReverbError names (BadDelay, BadGain, BadRange) plus NoCombs and TooManyStages.
think Hand-computed the two-comb + one-allpass impulse response [-8000,0,10000,-1333,8000,2000,5056,1000] and demanded the reverb equal BOTH that hand value AND an independent in-test composition (echo twice, saturating sum, allpass) — belt and suspenders. Also proved the single-comb/no-allpass degenerate IS ALES66's echo, silence stays silence, the tail settles to zero within the clip, and a loud two-comb sum saturates to the rail.
obs GREEN on the FIRST metal pass — the hand arithmetic matched the primitives exactly, and the composition-law and hand-value assertions agreed, which is the strongest evidence the network is honestly the sum of proven stages. TAME bans clean, width exit 0. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; no socket, network, keys, funds, device, or sample rate — no custody gate reached, a self-approved design round.
loom witness=ales_reverb_witness result=green cases=11 combs_max=16 allpasses_max=16
file active-designing/20260815-093042_fill-ales186-lotus-reverb.md the self-approved design read choosing the reverb crux and naming its five laws
file lotus/reverb.rye ALES186 — the reverb: wet = series_allpass(sum of parallel combs(dry)), composing echo (ALES66) and allpass (ALES184)
file tools/ales_reverb_witness.rish the witness — build, selftest, and the GREEN ales-reverb assertion on metal
